{"post_stream":{"posts":[{"id":151299,"name":"André","username":"Navarone66","avatar_template":"https://avatars.discourse-cdn.com/v4/letter/n/ecae2f/{size}.png","created_at":"2026-08-31T16:24:38.457Z","cooked":"\u003cp\u003eHi Ghost team,\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI have two Ghost(Pro) publications on my account and I’d like to move the content from one to the other:\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSource: \u003ca href=\"http://cork-tales.ghost.io\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ecork-tales.ghost.io\u003c/a\u003e\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDestination: \u003ca href=\"http://cork-tales-1.ghost.io\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ecork-tales-1.ghost.io\u003c/a\u003e (newly created, currently empty)\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eI’ve already exported the content JSON and the members CSV from the source site, but I understand images aren’t included in the export. Could you send me the image directory for \u003ca href=\"http://cork-tales.ghost.io\" rel=\"noopener nofollow ugc\"\u003ecork-tales.ghost.io\u003c/a\u003e so I can import it into the new site?\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eIf it’s simpler on your side to migrate the whole publication across directly, I’d be glad to go that route instead — the destination site has no content yet, so there’s nothing to overwrite. thanks!\u003c/p\u003e","post_number":1,"post_type":1,"posts_count":2,"updated_at":"2026-08-31T16:24:38.457Z","reply_count":0,"reply_to_post_number":null,"quote_count":0,"incoming_link_count":1,"reads":16,"readers_count":15,"score":8.2,"yours":false,"topic_id":63676,"topic_slug":"migrating-content-between-two-ghost-pro-publications","display_username":"André","primary_group_name":null,"flair_name":null,"flair_url":null,"flair_bg_color":null,"flair_color":null,"flair_group_id":null,"badges_granted":[],"version":1,"can_edit":false,"can_delete":false,"can_recover":false,"can_see_hidden_post":false,"can_wiki":false,"link_counts":[{"url":"http://cork-tales.ghost.io","inte